---
kind: lore
luteVersion: "0.18.0"
uses: ../world.schema.yaml
title: Haven's records
---

<entry id="purserLedger1" target="item.purser_ledger" category="note" series="purserLedger" order="1" title="Purser's ledger, page 1">
  @ottavio{code="0010"}: Manifest amended at the third bell. Two pods logged aboard that were never loaded.
  ::assert{knows(vesna, manifest)}
</entry>

<entry id="purserLedger2" target="item.purser_ledger" category="note" series="purserLedger" order="2" title="Purser's ledger, page 2" when="entry.purserLedger1.read">
  @ottavio{code="0010"}: If anyone reads this far: the heading on the bridge was never the true one.
  ::assert{knows(vesna, true_heading)}
</entry>

<entry id="shedPlaque" target="place.shed" category="place">
  <match on="run.shedPressure">
    <when is="2..">
      @narrator{code="0010"}: The brass plaque has buckled. Whatever the shed held, it held too much.
    </when>
    <when is="1">
      @narrator{code="0020"}: The brass plaque is warm to the touch, and slightly bowed.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @narrator{code="0030"}: A brass plaque: "Pressure shed. Crew access only."
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</entry>

<entry id="vesnaManifestBark" target="npc.vesna" category="bark" when="holds(knows(vesna, manifest))">
  @vesna{code="0010"}: Two pods that were never loaded. Somebody lied on paper, and I keep reading it.
</entry>
